description:
This is a unique travel souvenir to commemorate your every trip,you can frame it and hang it on the wall for decoration after completing the puzzle;
It is a challenging toy for children and adults to cultivate patience;
Made of 0.1 inches thick Basswood,ensures a tight, interlocking heirloom-quality puzzle;
This is a puzzle game that can develop your imagination and creativity and increase your hands-on ability.
